Modifications for DeepSeek Harness (also Apache-2.0):
  - state root environment variable CODEX_COMPANION_DATA_DIR (CLAUDE_PLUGIN_DATA
    kept as a fallback) and cross-process state locking with atomic writes;
  - plugin manifest path moved to runtime/plugin.json and clientInfo renamed;
  - optional --job-id override so Harness job ids and companion job records share
    one identity; jobId added to foreground JSON payloads;
  - --focus-file support for adversarial-review focus text;
  - typed refusals for app-server server-to-client requests (approvals,
    elicitation, user input, dynamic tools) instead of method-not-found;
  - broker idle reaping with active-turn protection, creation lock and atomic
    broker.json;
  - Claude session-transfer command and Claude-specific hooks removed;
  - lib/args.mjs: inline `--key=value` keeps every `=` after the first
    (openai/codex-plugin-cc#807);
  - lib/git.mjs: review context keeps the leading `git status --short` column
    (#813), reads non-ASCII paths via `-z` (#812), and caps the total size of
    inlined untracked files;
  - lib/codex.mjs, codex-companion.mjs: surrogate-safe `shorten` (#793); turn
    capture no longer hangs when the start response has no turn id (#781); a
    final `error` before an empty `turn/completed` is a failure and `turn.error`
    is captured (openai/codex#47728); `willRetry` errors are progress only;
  - lib/render.mjs: failed native reviews show the Codex error message;
  - lib/broker-lifecycle.mjs: a broker that misses its readiness window is
    killed instead of abandoned (#801, #789);
  - prompts/task.md, task-read-only.md, task-write.md (new) and lib/prompts.mjs:
    delegated tasks are wrapped in a task envelope with access rules, working
    rules and a handoff-report contract;
  - prompts/adversarial-review.md, schemas/review-output.schema.json: severity
    and confidence scales; failure_scenario, verification and residual_risks
    fields; reasoning-first key order;
  - lib/render.mjs: findings rendered with ids, confidence, scenario, fix and
    verification; native-review priority legend; summaries skip headings;
  - prompts/stop-review-gate.md removed (Claude-only, unused);
  - all DSH tool/command/prompt/skill integration in index.js and lib/.
